        "original_id": "24bf79aa-bd59-5860-b77b-b69d886df8c3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Epic Poker League, Federated Sports + Gaming, World Series of Poker, European Poker Tour\n- People: Jeffrey Pollack, Annie Duke, Matt Savage, Vanessa Selbst, Michael McDonald\n- Roles: Executive Chairman, Commissioner, Tournament Director\n- Topics: Poker tournaments, poker records\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Annie Duke won a World Series of Poker gold bracelet.\n- In 2011, Federated Sports + Gaming organized the Epic Poker League as a series of poker tournaments.\n- During the Epic Poker League in 2011, Jeffrey Pollack served as Executive Chairman, Annie Duke served as Commissioner, and Matt Savage served as Tournament Director.\n- Annie Duke was formerly the leading money winner among women in World Series of Poker history before Vanessa Selbst held that title.\n- Michael McDonald is the youngest person to win an event on the European Poker Tour.\n- Michael McDonald is also the youngest person to win an event on the Epic Poker League.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
